blank.gif, folder.gif and back.gif are unmodified copies of Apache httpd's
docs/icons (https://github.com/apache/httpd/tree/trunk/docs/icons). The relay
honeypot serves them under /icons/ so its directory listing looks stock.

From httpd's docs/icons/README:

     Public Domain Icons

     These icons were originally made for Mosaic for X and have been
     included in the NCSA httpd and Apache server distributions in the
     past. They are in the public domain and may be freely included in any
     application. The originals were done by Kevin Hughes (kevinh@kevcom.com).
     Andy Polyakov tuned the icon colors and added a few new images.
